OL,3,ADutch zookeeper dies after being mauled
OL,4,Ain leopard enclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn experienced keeper at a Dutch zoo
OL,7,Fhas died days after being mauled in a
OL,8,Fleopard enclosure, the safari park has
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FThe woman, who had worked at Beekse
OL,12,FBergen park for 40 years, was caring
OL,13,Ffor two Persian leopards in an indoor
OL,14,Ffacility when she was attacked on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FShe sustained injuries to her head and
OL,18,Fneck and had emergency surgery, but the
OL,19,Fpark confirmed her death on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
